{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32700","headline":"宣州献从叔大夫 · 李频","name":"宣州献从叔大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清时选地任贤明，从此观风辍尹京。\n日月天中辞洛邑，云山江上领宣城。\n万家闾井俱安寝，千里农桑竟起耕。\n闻说圣朝同汉代，已愁徵入拜公卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}